1
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:45,400
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:46,950
[Episode 26]

3
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:47,410
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Author: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:58,440 --> 00:00:59,240
Hello?

6
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,400
Where are you?

7
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:02,920
I'm at my mom's.

8
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,519
Why didn't you come home?

9
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:08,560
My mom wanted to get out.

10
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:11,160
So I’ll spend a couple days with her.

11
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:14,160
It’ll also give me time to think.

12
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:15,560
Tinglan,

13
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:17,289
don't overthink it.

14
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:19,280
We'll be fine.

15
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:21,360
Yeah, I know.

16
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:24,520
By the way,

17
00:01:25,060 --> 00:01:26,320
your dad...

18
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:28,010
Don't worry.

19
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:29,039
He's fine now.

20
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:31,680
That's good.

21
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:34,620
We'll be back tomorrow night.

22
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,830
I'll wait for you at home

23
00:01:36,830 --> 00:01:38,759
and make you something delicious.

24
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:40,880
Okay.

25
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:55,759
Tinglan,

26
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:58,000
this place is really nice.

27
00:01:59,009 --> 00:02:00,240
I chose it for you.

28
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:01,780
I guessed you'd like it.

29
00:02:01,780 --> 00:02:03,200
I love it.

30
00:02:04,580 --> 00:02:05,120
This way.

31
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:05,640
Okay.

32
00:02:07,810 --> 00:02:08,520
Mom,

33
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,200
we'll stay here tonight.

34
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,040
Tinglan,

35
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:14,520
it's quite nice here.

36
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,880
There's even a yard.

37
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:19,680
Mom,

38
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:20,120
have a seat.

39
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:20,640
Okay.

40
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:23,520
I'll help you change your shoes.

41
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,450
Let's change the shoes.

42
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:33,170
What do you feel like for dinner?

43
00:02:33,170 --> 00:02:35,240
Anything is fine. You decide.

44
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,490
Hello, Lawyer Xiao.

45
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:52,500
The trial is on Monday.

46
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:54,000
Familiarize yourself with the case files.

47
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,600
Let's try to win this battle.

48
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:56,320
Okay.

49
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:57,850
I'll sort it out right away.

50
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:00,720
Mom,

51
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:02,880
I have to work overtime.

52
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:03,960
When I'm done,

53
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:04,920
I'll take you out to eat,

54
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:05,520
okay?

55
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:06,760
Tinglan,

56
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:09,440
still working on a weekend?

57
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:12,680
Don’t overdo it.

58
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:14,160
I feel bad.

59
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:15,800
I finally have time to take you out,

60
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,130
but I still have to work.

61
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:20,360
Work comes first.

62
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:21,560
If you feel bored,

63
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:22,890
go for a walk in the yard.

64
00:03:23,420 --> 00:03:24,079
Okay.

65
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:03,560
Please,

66
00:04:04,030 --> 00:04:05,440
don't cause trouble for Tinglan.

67
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:06,440
Please,

68
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:08,330
don't make things hard for her.

69
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,440
Please!

70
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:11,920
Aunt Zhang.

71
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:14,560
Please get it straight.

72
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:17,720
I'm not causing trouble for Shu Tinglan.

73
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:20,399
But you are.

74
00:04:24,430 --> 00:04:26,090
Poor mother, lowly daughter,

75
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:28,320
dreaming of marrying up

76
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:29,520
and rising to the top?

77
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,840
Does Shu Tinglan have what it takes?

78
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:33,560
Not to mention,

79
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:37,120
she's stuck with a mother like you.

80
00:04:37,770 --> 00:04:39,600
She's just delusional.

81
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:43,240
I didn't!

82
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:44,800
I didn't affect Tinglan!

83
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,320
I didn't drag Tinglan down!

84
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:46,760
I...

85
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:48,400
I... I didn't...

86
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:50,040
I didn't burden Tinglan.

87
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:51,440
I didn't...

88
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:06,410
Hello, Lawyer Xiao.

89
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:07,200
Okay.

90
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:09,120
I'll send it to you in a bit.

91
00:05:14,750 --> 00:05:16,030
I'm currently working

92
00:05:16,060 --> 00:05:17,920
on the evidence
for the plaintiff's qualification.

93
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:18,720
Okay.

94
00:05:20,330 --> 00:05:21,240
Tinglan,

95
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:23,330
I'm going out for a walk.

96
00:05:23,330 --> 00:05:23,680
Okay.

97
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,340
Mom.

98
00:05:24,440 --> 00:05:25,240
Take care.

99
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,360
And the analysis of the key issues

100
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,600
is not finished yet.

101
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:30,920
Okay.

102
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:31,970
Understood.

103
00:05:45,990 --> 00:05:46,600
Okay.

104
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:47,600
Yes.

105
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,480
Okay.

106
00:06:08,080 --> 00:06:08,640
Mom?

107
00:06:09,270 --> 00:06:09,800
Mom?

108
00:06:13,460 --> 00:06:14,240
Mom?

109
00:06:17,210 --> 00:06:18,200
Mom?

110
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:26,920
Mom?

111
00:06:30,190 --> 00:06:31,160
Mom?

112
00:06:39,780 --> 00:06:41,240
Excuse me, sir.

113
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,280
Have you seen my mom?

114
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:45,080
She went to the stream,

115
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:46,730
looking for a little sweater.

116
00:06:46,730 --> 00:06:47,240
Okay.

117
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:47,870
I see.

118
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:48,480
Thank you.

119
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:49,440
Mom?

120
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:50,720
Hey, Miss.

121
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,720
It's going to rain.

122
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,159
Mom?

123
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,200
Mom?

124
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:07,760
Mom?

125
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:08,920
Mom?

126
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:13,800
Mom?

127
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:48,600
Mom!

128
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:22,040
Uncle Zhuo,

129
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:24,130
I know what you're going to say.

130
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:25,800
But until Zhuo Yu'an agrees,

131
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,580
I won't agree to a divorce.

132
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,680
Miss Shu,

133
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:32,120
I know your love is strong.

134
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:34,720
But do you realize

135
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:38,179
this relationship was a mistake
from the start?

136
00:08:38,309 --> 00:08:40,360
It's rotten to the core.

137
00:08:40,450 --> 00:08:41,720
One day,

138
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:44,000
you'll destroy the Zhuo family

139
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,330
and destroy Zhuo Yu'an.

140
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:47,280
Since we chose each other,

141
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:49,480
we have to keep going

142
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:51,240
to find out

143
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:52,290
the outcome.

144
00:08:52,910 --> 00:08:56,000
Young people are always naïve.

145
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:57,600
Fighting a losing battle

146
00:08:58,280 --> 00:09:00,080
is always a thankless task.

147
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:01,720
In the end,

148
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:05,240
those without protection always get hurt.

149
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,960
Thanks for your concern.

150
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,940
But since I made my choice,

151
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,200
I don't care.

152
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:14,280
You don't care,

153
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:16,540
but what about the people around you?

154
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:18,640
Your mother, Zhang He.

155
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,560
friend Lin Zhihuan,

156
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,280
Your boss.

157
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:23,920
Your co-workers.

158
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:26,520
The ties in this world

159
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:28,760
are always more than you imagine.

160
00:09:35,420 --> 00:09:38,700
[Divorce Agreement]

161
00:09:51,070 --> 00:09:54,770
♪ A meteor crossed the promise we made ♪

162
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:57,360
♪ Memories fade at a touch ♪

163
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:57,770
Hello, Tinglan.

164
00:09:58,100 --> 00:10:00,330
♪ Seasons turn and fade ♪

165
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,280
I'm cooking.

166
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,680
What would you like for dinner?

167
00:10:00,590 --> 00:10:04,840
♪ I still feel your hand in mine ♪

168
00:10:02,040 --> 00:10:02,920
Zhuo Yu'an…

169
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:08,720
♪ Time slips away ♪

170
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,480
Let's get a divorce.

171
00:10:09,140 --> 00:10:13,180
♪ Regrets left unsaid rush in ♪

172
00:10:09,630 --> 00:10:10,960
What happened?

173
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:15,870
♪ The warmth we shared ♪

174
00:10:15,940 --> 00:10:19,490
♪ Still lives within ♪

175
00:10:20,780 --> 00:10:24,260
♪ Back then, joy came far too easy ♪

176
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:26,850
♪ We knew how to waste it all ♪

177
00:10:27,490 --> 00:10:29,830
♪ Before we learned to hold it tight ♪

178
00:10:29,910 --> 00:10:32,500
♪ We let each other fall ♪

179
00:10:33,340 --> 00:10:35,130
♪ One last time ♪

180
00:10:35,250 --> 00:10:38,830
♪ I walked with you around that bend ♪

181
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:42,340
♪ A hug said all we couldn't say ♪

182
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,410
It's a pity

183
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:44,470
♪ We once had everything ♪

184
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,680
I can't cook now.

185
00:10:44,680 --> 00:10:45,250
Otherwise,

186
00:10:44,730 --> 00:10:46,020
♪ This time we lost our way ♪

187
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:47,480
I wouldn't let you get so thin.

188
00:10:46,490 --> 00:10:49,060
♪ Don't forget me ♪

189
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,600
When you get better,

190
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:50,130
I'll make you cook for me.

191
00:10:49,290 --> 00:10:52,770
♪ The wind blew us apart ♪

192
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:51,150
Five meals a day,

193
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:52,670
until you can't stand it.

194
00:10:52,670 --> 00:10:53,670
Okay.

195
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:56,720
♪ We ran, we cried, we laughed as one ♪

196
00:10:53,980 --> 00:10:54,710
It's my fault

197
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:56,800
for dragging you down.

198
00:10:56,800 --> 00:11:00,200
♪ Walked through every twist and turn ♪

199
00:10:57,280 --> 00:10:58,440
At such a young age,

200
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:01,680
you had to think everything through.

201
00:11:00,330 --> 00:11:04,120
♪ Yet missed the happiness so near ♪

202
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,200
Neither of us

203
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:05,730
♪ Only after we've lost ♪

204
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:05,720
is a burden to the other.

205
00:11:05,830 --> 00:11:07,600
♪ And can't touch again ♪

206
00:11:07,710 --> 00:11:11,390
♪ Do we truly know what we had ♪

207
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:13,710
♪ We loved ♪

208
00:11:14,180 --> 00:11:19,040
♪ Beneath the stars, we froze in time ♪

209
00:11:27,130 --> 00:11:30,650
♪ Back then, joy came far too easy ♪

210
00:11:30,460 --> 00:11:33,440
[Late Mother Zhang He]

211
00:11:30,850 --> 00:11:33,240
♪ We knew how to waste it all ♪

212
00:11:34,060 --> 00:11:36,270
♪ Before we learned to hold it tight ♪

213
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:34,640
Mom,

214
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:36,320
I failed you.

215
00:11:36,410 --> 00:11:38,990
♪ We let each other fall ♪

216
00:11:39,910 --> 00:11:41,490
♪ One last time ♪

217
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:41,120
I might not be able

218
00:11:41,590 --> 00:11:45,170
♪ I walked with you around that bend ♪

219
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:43,620
to keep my promise.

220
00:11:45,300 --> 00:11:48,770
♪ A hug said all we couldn't say ♪

221
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:48,800
I want to start over.

222
00:11:48,860 --> 00:11:50,740
♪ We once had everything ♪

223
00:11:50,520 --> 00:11:51,840
You won't blame me,

224
00:11:51,070 --> 00:11:52,440
♪ This time we lost our way ♪

225
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,200
right?

226
00:11:52,810 --> 00:11:55,500
♪ Don't forget me ♪

227
00:11:55,860 --> 00:11:59,200
♪ The wind blew us apart ♪

228
00:11:59,380 --> 00:12:03,200
♪ We ran, we cried, we laughed as one ♪

229
00:12:03,370 --> 00:12:06,660
♪ Walked through every twist and turn ♪

230
00:12:06,790 --> 00:12:10,540
♪ Yet missed the happiness so near ♪

231
00:12:10,670 --> 00:12:12,200
♪ Only after we've lost ♪

232
00:12:12,280 --> 00:12:14,040
♪ And can't touch again ♪

233
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:14,240
Tinglan?

234
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:17,960
♪ Do we truly know what we had ♪

235
00:12:15,260 --> 00:12:16,200
Tinglan?

236
00:12:18,130 --> 00:12:20,060
♪ We loved ♪

237
00:12:20,530 --> 00:12:25,790
♪ Beneath the stars, we froze in time ♪

238
00:12:31,140 --> 00:12:36,680
