♪ The wind blew us apart ♪

240
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:49,400
♪ We ran, we cried, we laughed as one ♪

241
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:52,880
♪ Walked through every twist and turn ♪

242
00:12:51,260 --> 00:12:53,950
[Divorce Agreement]

243
00:12:53,010 --> 00:12:56,800
♪ Yet missed the happiness so near ♪

244
